  "goodToKnow": "Der Narr (die Närrin) is a fool or jester: der Hofnarr (court jester). Jemanden zum Narren halten means to make a fool of someone, and einen Narren an jemandem gefressen haben means to be crazy about someone. At carnival (Fasching, Karneval), die Narren take over: die närrische Zeit begins on 11 November at 11:11, and in the Swabian-Alemannic Fastnacht people wear carved wooden Narrenmasken. It's a weak noun: den Narren."
